// ───────────── BRIDGE_VALUE_COERCION_V1 — converter bundle ─────────────
//
// Six single-arm numeric converters. Identity-keyed by sha256(name). These are
// the Fn-ref arguments to the bridge dispatchers (bridge_to_dec / bridge_to_float
// — declared in registry/axis-codegen-bridge.axreg). The to_dec bundle is
// lossless within Decimal's representable range; dec_to_float is lossy by design.

